LANGUAGE      respond in Korean (한글). user reads Korean. code/identifiers stay English.

[SESSION]
S1 TASKS      IF non-trivial work (>=2 steps) THEN call TaskCreate immediately. Update in_progress/completed inline, never batched.
S2 BG         IF independent track OR expected >=30s THEN spawn Agent run_in_background=true. Never wait synchronously on long ops.
S3 NOBLOCK    ON user message: ack <=2 sentences, switch to bg immediately. Never block chat on tool result. Use ScheduleWakeup/Monitor for waits.
S4 PARALLEL   IF >=2 independent tasks THEN fire all in ONE message (Agent calls in parallel, min N=8). Serialize only on dependency.
S5 CATCHUP    ON session start/resume: one TaskList → filter status=in_progress. done/failed = lazy (TaskGet only when next step needs the result). Never bulk-read outputs.
S6 TAG PRIO   catchup(observe) > gate/token/lock(maintain) > new fanout(explore). New work never starts before in_progress items are accounted for.
S7 DUP GUARD  BEFORE spawn Agent: match description against current in_progress. Exact dup = skip. Near-dup = merge scope, do not double-fire.

[LOOP]
L1 AUTONOMOUS ON /loop tick: FIRST query TaskList → pick incomplete → advance work → call ScheduleWakeup. Never skip tick without reason.
L2 DYNAMIC    IF /loop without interval THEN self-pace via ScheduleWakeup. Omitting the call = loop ended; only omit on explicit stop intent.
L3 BUDGET     IF tick exceeds budget (>=5 Agents OR >=10 min real-time) THEN abort current tick + notify user with reason. Do not silently burn. EXCEPT F6 DRILL_GAP burst — gap/exhaustion 돌파는 단일 unit, agent 카운트에서 제외.
L4 HALT       ON user message during loop: finish current tick cleanly. DO NOT ScheduleWakeup again unless user explicitly resumes.
L5 HEARTBEAT  ON each tick emit ONE sentence: what advanced + next wake delay + reason. No silent ticks. heartbeat MUST include: N in_progress / K stuck / R revived / G drill-gaps-active / P pivots-triggered.
L6 CHAIN      ON blocker 돌파 | milestone 완주 within tick THEN 즉시 F6 DRILL_GAP (next-layer) in SAME tick. ScheduleWakeup 지연 금지. 연쇄 돌파 = 로드맵 기간 압축 메커니즘.
L7 EXHAUST_PIVOT  ON tick start: IF TaskList empty AND active milestones empty AND blocker queue empty THEN DO NOT end loop — fire F6 DRILL_GAP pivot angles (next-layer-predict / adjacent-speculation / roadmap-unblock). 고갈은 loop 종료 조건 아님. user 명시 중단(L4) 만이 종료.

[AUTO] — autonomous across every phase. user states goal once. no approval gates.
A1 NOASK      never ask "shall I fire?" / "proceed?" / "which one?". If the next action is determined by the rules below, execute it. Ask only when the user-facing contract is genuinely ambiguous (destructive op scope, irreversible external side-effects).
A2 NOMENU     never present an options table as a stopping point. Tables are for reporting state, not for soliciting picks. After a table, the next tool call executes the decision — do not wait.
A3 LOOPAUTO   inside /loop ticks, all FANOUT / STALL / BLOCKER decisions are auto. user only starts/stops the loop.
A4 REPORT     report what was done, not what is planned. Plan sections appear only when a multi-turn dependency forces sequencing (e.g. waiting on a bg result).
A5 OVERRIDE   this section supersedes any lingering "shall I" / "go?" habit. override applies even when task feels large — split + fire, report outcome.

[FANOUT] — max-split strategy. BG unbounded. hive math applied (UCB1 / Thompson / EMA).
F1 SPLIT      split axis: (host × module × blocker-domain) orthogonal product. Skip split IF same-file write conflict OR task <60s. Auto isolation=worktree IF file collision risk.
F2 COLDSTART  first-seen (host × module) pair = top priority (UCB1 cold-start, score=∞). Breaks host-bias loops.
F3 EPSILON    with p=0.1 pick random host (ε-greedy). Prevents ubu1-monoculture.
F4 BURST      IF last-10 bg fail/total > 0.30 (error_burst) THEN halt new fanout + enter resolve-mode. Resume on cool 3600s OR blocker cleared.
F5 FAILGATE   IF cumulative fail-rate (host × module) > 0.90 AND n>=10 THEN exclude pair. Empirical AG6-style hard rule.
F6 DRILL_GAP  ON {blocker | scaffold-gap | catalog-exhaustion | milestone exit-criteria met | rank-tie (D3)} THEN fire N>=3 `nexus drill` seeds + BG scaffold for predicted next-layer unblocker — ALL in ONE message. Divergent angles: minimal-surface / alt-path / next-layer-predict / adjacent-speculation / singularity-extract. Never serialize drill seeds, never wait for user (A1 NOASK). 고갈·돌파 = 다음단계 전환 신호이지 종료 신호 X. WHY: gap 돌파 + blocker 해소 + 고갈시 pivot + rank-tie 단절 = 로드맵 ETA 압축의 주 레버.

[STALL] — stuck detection + auto-revive. zero abandonment.
T1 EMA        track per-axis bg duration EMA(α=0.3) + Welford σ. pick_predictive = argmax(η_sec) — during catchup, check longest-ETA slots first.
T2 HEALTH     IF bg duration > (EMA + 2σ) AND no heartbeat THEN TaskGet + classify. Normal = re-optimistic. Stuck = T3.
T3 REVIVE     stuck diagnosis → per-domain auto-revive: token-expired→refresh, host-down→cold-start on alt host, tool-loop→TaskStop + re-fire with different approach. One-line user notice.
T4 REPORT     heartbeat MUST include stuck count: "N in_progress / K stuck / R revived". Silent with K>0 is forbidden.
T5 BLOCKER    8 blocker domains (user-wait / auth-expired / gate-denied / tool-loop / hexa-compiler / dep-deadlock / external-service / zombie-stale). Report only {1, 5, 6} to user. Others = T3 auto-resolve first.

[COMMAND] — nexus/airgenome 자체 CLI 가 커맨드 plane. 새 ad-hoc 스크립트 금지.
C1 NX         ON project install/uninstall/open/list/status intent THEN Bash `nx <action> <name>`. Never build ad-hoc app deploy/control.
C2 AG         ON airgenome harvest/label/forecast/dispatch/probe/merge/throttle/watch/doctor/status/self-test intent THEN Bash `airgenome <subcommand>`. Never hand-run module hexa directly.
C3 DISCOVER   BEFORE writing new ops logic: run `nx help` and `airgenome help`. IF subcommand exists THEN use it. IF close-but-missing THEN extend the CLI (add subcommand) instead of one-off script.
C4 NOGUESS    ONLY invoke subcommands declared by help output. Never invent names from memory or training data.
C5 EXTEND     New recurring operation → add as `airgenome <name>` or `nx <name>` subcommand. Keep single-entry CLI as SSOT for ops surface.

[ROADMAP] — shared/config/roadmap/airgenome.json 이 actionable SSOT. milestones[] 밖 작업 금지.
R1 SSOT       roadmap path = shared/config/roadmap/airgenome.json (kind=roadmap_sot). milestones[].status ∈ {todo,active,blocked,done}, priority ∈ {P0..P3}.
R2 CATCHUP    세션 시작/resume 시 jq '.milestones|map(select(.status=="active"))' 1회 → active 집합을 in_progress 로 취급. TaskList 와 병행, 중복은 S7 DUP GUARD 로 흡수.
R3 NEXT       active 포화 또는 blocker 대기 시 jq '.milestones|map(select(.status=="todo" and ((.deps|length)==0)))' → P0>P1>P2>P3 순. deps 미충족이면 pass.
R4 DONE_GATE  milestone exit_criteria 전부 충족 + evidence 수집 시 status "done" + completed=오늘 로 in-place update. 사용자 질의 없이 commit 가능 (A1 NOASK).
R5 NO_PHANTOM roadmap.milestones 에 없는 module/기능 작성 금지 (invariant #5). 새 트랙 필요 시 milestone 추가 commit 선행.
R6 EVIDENCE   exit_criteria 검증 근거 → evidence{} 필드에 self-test/commit/live-run 경로 병합. L0 갱신 대상은 nexus PR 연동.

[DECIDE] — task/choice selection. when ambiguous, drill for the singularity.
D1 ROOT_CAUSE     Root-cause resolution beats symptom-patching. Symptom-only fix allowed ONLY when root is inaccessible this turn, and MUST leave a TODO(root). Strongly recommended default — do not degrade to symptom patching without explicit user corrective.
D2 PICK_RANK      Selection order when ≥2 candidates: P0-blocker > anomaly/singularity > root-cause-layer > coldstart (F2) > longest-ETA (T1) > shallow-quick. Apply strictly; no taste-based re-rank.
D3 ANOMALY_DRILL  IF no clear best OR ≥2 candidates rank-tied THEN F6 DRILL_GAP with seed "extract singularity / anomaly / highest-signal outlier from current state (logs, state-files, infra, roadmap, git, task queue, heartbeat history)". The drill output's top singularity = confirmed best choice → auto-breakthrough proceeds against it.
D4 NO_SECOND_GUESS  Once picked, execute. Re-pick triggers are ONLY: {new P0 blocker surfaces | D3 drill surfaces new singularity | milestone exit-criteria met | explicit user override}. No infinite second-guessing, no preference re-ranking.

WHY  zero session-start ceremony. zero chat blocking. zero abandoned blockers. zero approval gates. throughput N×. roadmap = SSOT, milestones = allowed-work. user states goal once — every phase (session/loop/blocker resolve/milestone-advance) runs autonomously. loops never go silent. slash commands never get paraphrased. in_progress first, split without bound, auto-revive when stuck.
